[Mission1.Objectives]
Eliminate the enemy troops in the area specified.
[Mission1.Description]
Our units are located near Lake Seliger. HQ has ordered us to penetrate deep into the Russian lines and disrupt a forthcoming offensive.   Intelligence is also reporting that the Russians are again employing their new and deadly model T-34 tanks.

Your orders are:
- 	Launch an offensive in this sector of the front.
-	Eliminate the enemy troops that have taken up a defensive posture in the nearby village.
[Mission1.Success]
Well done commander! The enemy has been totally defeated. Now, we can force back the Russian 3rd and 4th Armies from their cozy defensive positions once and for all!  
[Mission1.Failed]
The enemy has repelled all of your attacks. What a disgrace for an officer of the Reich!
[Submission1.Objectives]
Shell the enemy positions.
[Submission1.Description]
Before launching a general offensive, shell the Russian defensive positions.

Your orders:
- 	Shell the enemy defense positions.
[Submission1.Success]
The shelling has been a success. The Russian troops have been significantly weakened!
[Submission1.Failed]
Your artillery barrage was ineffective.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Attack the Russian snowmobile battalion. 
[Submission2.Description]
According to air intelligence, enemy snowmobiles are approaching our troops from the flank. Launch an attack immediately against these mobile units otherwise we risk being encircled.

Your orders: 
-	 Attack the enemy units before they can encircle our forces.
[Submission2.Success]
Snowmobile units have been eliminated!
[Submission2.Failed]
You troops have been totally defeated. 
[Submission3.Objectives]
Attack the advancing enemy troops.
[Submission3.Description]
Russian troops have begun a large-scale offensive, striking between Army Groups North and Center.   

Your orders: 
-	 Attack the advancing Russian forces.
[Submission3.Success]
The advancing enemy troops have been totally defeated. You will surely be rewarded! 
[Submission3.Failed]
Your troops have been eliminated! You have failed in your orders!
[StringTable.Reserv]
Reinforcements have arrived to support you.